---
// src/pages/privacy.astro - Comprehensive, transparent Privacy Policy page
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy ― FancyFonts.com | Zero Keystroke Logging Guarantee"
  description="Read the Privacy Policy of FancyFonts.com. Discover our zero keystroke logging commitment: all fancy font generation happens 100% locally in your browser."
  keywords="privacy policy, fancy fonts privacy, zero keystroke logging, font generator privacy, gdpr compliance, ccpa"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-grow py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)] mb-8" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header Title -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-xs mb-3">
        <span>🛡️</span> Privacy-First Guarantee
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[var(--foreground)] tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] mt-2">
        Last Updated: September 6, 2026 • Effective Date: January 1, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Highlight Box: Zero Keystroke Logging -->
    <div class="mb-12 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl theme-panel border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 shadow-xs">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="text-3xl flex-shrink-0">🔒</span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--foreground)]">Our Core Privacy Commitment: Zero Server-Side Text Processing</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            FancyFonts.com processes all font conversions <strong>100% locally inside your web browser</strong> using client-side JavaScript. When you type or paste text into our generator, that text never leaves your device. We do <strong>not</strong> record, log, store, or transmit your text inputs to any remote server or third party.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Policy Content Body -->
    <div class="space-y-10 text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl theme-panel border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>1.</span> Introduction
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          At FancyFonts.com (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;our,&rdquo; or &ldquo;us&rdquo;), we believe privacy is a fundamental digital right. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you visit our website (https://fancyfonts.com) and use our Unicode fancy text conversion tools.
        </p>
        <p>
          By accessing or using FancyFonts.com, you acknowledge that you understand and accept the practices outlined in this policy. If you do not agree with this policy, please refrain from using our service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl theme-panel border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>2.</span> Information We Do Not Collect
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          To provide total peace of mind for our visitors, our platform is intentionally designed without data collection mechanisms:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-3">
          <li><strong>No User Account or Registration:</strong> You do not need to create an account, log in, or provide your name, phone number, or address to use FancyFonts.com.</li>
          <li><strong>No Text Logging:</strong> Keystrokes, copied phrases, and pasted messages remain strictly in your browser's temporary memory (RAM) and are cleared upon closing or refreshing your browser tab.</li>
          <li><strong>No Financial or Payment Information:</strong> Our services are completely free. We do not process credit cards or maintain billing records.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl theme-panel border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>3.</span> Information Automatically Collected
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Like virtually all websites, our servers and Content Delivery Network (CDN) providers automatically receive standard technical requests when your browser connects to our website. This includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-3">
          <li><strong>Technical Device & Browser Info:</strong> Browser type, operating system (e.g., iOS, Android, Windows, macOS), language preferences, and screen resolution to ensure responsive layout rendering.</li>
          <li><strong>IP Address & Network Logs:</strong> Standard server logs collected by network infrastructure providers for DDoS mitigation, bot detection, and server security. These logs are routinely purged.</li>
          <li><strong>Aggregated Web Performance Metrics:</strong> Total page visits and resource load times to help us optimize speed and prevent server bottlenecks.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl theme-panel border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>4.</span> Cookies and Local Storage
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          FancyFonts.com maintains a minimal footprint when it comes to client-side storage:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-3">
          <li><strong>Theme Preferences (localStorage):</strong> We use your browser's <code>localStorage</code> solely to remember your chosen theme setting (Dark Mode or Light Mode) so you do not experience a visual flash when navigating pages.</li>
          <li><strong>No Cross-Site Tracking Cookies:</strong> We do not deploy invasive third-party tracking cookies or behavioral profile beacons.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You can clear your browser's local storage and cookies at any time via your browser settings without impacting your ability to use the font generator.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl theme-panel border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>5.</span> Third-Party Services
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          We may utilize reputable third-party infrastructure partners to deliver our static website files swiftly and securely worldwide (such as Cloudflare or Vercel edge networks). These providers operate in compliance with strict international security standards.
        </p>
        <p>
          FancyFonts.com does not sell, rent, monetize, or trade any visitor data with advertising brokers or data harvesting entities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl theme-panel border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>6.</span> Compliance with GDPR and CCPA / CPRA
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          If you are a resident of the European Economic Area (EEA), United Kingdom, or California, you enjoy specific statutory privacy rights:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-3">
          <li><strong>Right to Know & Access:</strong> The right to request disclosure of what personal data a service holds about you (as stated, we do not maintain personal profiles or store your text).</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Deletion:</strong> The right to request erasure of any collected records.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Non-Discrimination:</strong> You will never be denied services or charged different rates for exercising your privacy rights.</li>
          <li><strong>Do Not Sell My Personal Information:</strong> We do not sell personal data under any circumstance.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl theme-panel border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>7.</span> Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA)
        </h2>
        <p>
          FancyFonts.com is designed for general audiences and does not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under the age of 13. Because our service operates without registration, accounts, or data storage, no personal data from minors is held on our systems.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl theme-panel border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>8.</span> Policy Updates and Inquiries
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          We may periodically update this Privacy Policy to reflect technical or legal improvements. The updated date at the top of this document indicates the latest revision.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have questions, concerns, or privacy inquiries, please contact our designated privacy team at:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl theme-well border border-[var(--border)] font-mono text-xs">
          Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@fancyfonts.com" class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 hover:underline">privacy@fancyfonts.com</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
